  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "取经四人走到一处密林前，前边又无路了。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "四个人走到这里，前边一片密林，又没有路了。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "唐僧在石头上大模大样坐下，命孙悟空去给自己找些吃的。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我饿了，给我找些吃的来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "孙悟空拄着棒子拒绝去找吃的，说自己正忙着，反问唐僧自己没有腿、为何不自己去找。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我正忙着，你不会自己去找？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "孙悟空望着天边说晚霞很美，并称自己只有看看晚霞，才能每天坚持向西走下去。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我只有看看这个，才能每天坚持向西走下去啊"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "孙悟空表示自己看晚霞的时候不做任何事。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我看晚霞的时候不做任何事！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "猪八戒对孙悟空说：不能这样欺负秃头（指唐僧），若把他饿死了就找不到西天，而找不到西天，他们身上的诅咒就永远解除不了。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我们身上的诅咒永远也解除不了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "孙悟空骂猪八戒是“猪头”，猪八戒怒称“你说谁是猪”，并举钉耙要冲上去。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "猪八戒举着钉耙就要往上冲"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "沙和尚大吼让众人别吵，说自己要困觉了，要打就滚远些打。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "老子要困觉了！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "叙述称孙悟空、猪八戒、沙和尚三人“怒目而视”，此前的互相争吵暂时停住。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "三个恶棍怒目而视"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-10",
      "text": "唐僧站起身来说“打吧打吧，打死一个少一个”，并称徒弟们是“大爷”，由自己去给他们找吃的。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "打死一个少一个"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-11",
      "text": "唐僧说若自己在林中路上被妖怪吃了，徒弟们那时就只能哭。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那时你们就哭吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-12",
      "text": "孙悟空冲唐僧叫道“那儿有女妖精正等着你呢”，三个徒弟都冷笑。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那儿有女妖精正等着你呢"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-13",
      "text": "叙述将孙悟空、猪八戒、沙和尚三人称作“三个怪物”，称三人都冷笑。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "三个怪物都冷笑"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-14",
      "text": "唐僧说“别以为我离了你们就不行”，朝徒弟们挥挥拳头、拍拍身上尘土、整整长袍，开始向林中走去；刚迈一步，僧袍就“嘶啦”一声扯破。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 1,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000001.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000001",
          "chapter_order": 1,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "僧袍就扯破了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
